; English texts of the installer (included by Hitman2Enhanced.iss). UTF-8 with BOM.
[CustomMessages]
en.GroupFixes=Fixes to enable (each one can be changed later in h2e.ini):
en.TaskResolution=Resolution: fullscreen keeps any resolution (1080p, 1440p, ...)
en.TaskMenuScale=Menu scaling: menus, briefing and pause menu fill the screen
en.TaskFrameLimit=Frame-rate limit at your monitor's refresh rate (the game breaks above ~1024 FPS)
en.TaskTimer=Game clock: correct game speed at any frame rate
en.TaskSettings=Settings page in game (F10): resolution, display mode, field of view, frame-rate limit
en.TaskHdFonts=HD fonts: sharp menu text, built from your own game files (about 1 minute)
en.BuildingFonts=Building HD fonts from your game files (about 1 minute)...
en.NoGame=hitman2.exe was not found in this folder.%n%nChoose the Hitman 2: Silent Assassin folder (Steam: right-click the game > Manage > Browse local files).
en.ForeignDll=This folder already contains a d3d8.dll that belongs to another mod.%n%nRemove that mod first; Hitman 2 Enhanced will not overwrite it.
en.UnknownExe=This hitman2.exe is not one of the versions the fixes were made for (Steam 1.0.0.277, retail/disc 1.0.0.265).%n%nThe fixes check the game version and stay inactive on other versions (only the frame-rate limit and the settings page work). Install anyway?
en.ProjectPage=Project page and source code:
en.NotWritable=Files cannot be written to this folder without administrator rights.%n%nClose this installer and start it again with right-click > Run as administrator.

[Messages]
en.WelcomeLabel2=This installs Hitman 2 Enhanced {#AppVersion} by {#Author}, unofficial open-source fixes for Hitman 2: Silent Assassin (Steam): modern resolutions, full-screen menus, a frame-rate limit, a correct game clock, an in-game settings page (F10) and HD fonts.%n%nNo game file is modified, and everything can be uninstalled from Windows Settings.%n%nThe next page explains exactly what is changed.
en.FinishedLabel=Hitman 2 Enhanced is installed.%n%nStart the game from Steam and press F10 in the main menu to choose your resolution, display mode, field of view and frame-rate limit. Resolution and display mode apply after restarting the game.%n%nMade by {#Author}.
en.SelectDirLabel3=Select the Hitman 2: Silent Assassin folder (the one that contains hitman2.exe).
